name=Farm Trailer
id=FarmTrailer
require=\PROJECTRVInterior42,\KI5trailers
description=Turn KI5's livestock trailer into a 12 x 40 outdoor farm you can tow. Grow crops, keep animals and build a little homestead inside. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=Each trailer gets its own persistent plot with soil, wooden walls and two empty water collectors, 800 L total. No roof. Weather, seasons and animal care apply. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=<H2> Get in <LINE> <TEXT> 
description=Load map_distanciado before Muldraugh, KY in the world's map list. Stand beside an unlocked KI5 livestock trailer and choose the RV Interior entry in the vehicle radial. Inside, right-click the ground to leave. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=<H2> Water and animals <LINE> <TEXT> 
description=- To pump from a river or lake, carry a Rubber Hose, hitch the trailer to a vehicle with a charged battery, park within six tiles of the water and choose Fill farm tanks. <LINE> 
description=- Load an animal into the trailer, then choose Bring livestock into farm in the vehicle radial. <LINE> <LINE> 
description=Needs Project RV Interior, Trailers! and that DAMN Library. Works in multiplayer.
